    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "We are delighted to offer for sale No.9 Oxfield Road, Lissadell Park, Carney, a very well-presented three-bedroom end-terraced home situated in this popular residential development on the edge of Carney village. The property which is being sold complete with all furnishings and appliances, is set in a wonderful location, with superb views towards iconic Benbulben mountain. The house is within easy walking distance of the village centre and its local amenities, while some of North Sligo's most beautiful beaches, walking routes and outdoor attractions are also close by.\r\n\r\nThe property has been well maintained throughout and offers bright, spacious and comfortable accommodation. The Living Room is a very appealing reception space, with a feature fireplace and a large bay window. Double doors lead through to the Kitchen / Dining room.\r\n\r\nThe Kitchen / Dining room is fitted with oak-style units. A bay window bringing plenty of natural light into the room, overlooks the property's south-facing rear garden. A Guest WC completes the ground floor accommodation.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the property provides three well-proportioned bedrooms. The principal bedroom benefits from fitted wardrobes, an ensuite shower room and double doors opening onto a glass balustrade balcony. Bedroom 2 also has double doors leading to a balcony, while Bedroom 3 provides a versatile additional bedroom, home office or study space.\r\n\r\nThe family bathroom is fully fitted and tiled, incorporating a bath with shower over, WC and wash-hand basin.\r\n\r\nOutside, the property benefits from a fully walled site, with a south-facing rear garden. Parking is to the rear of the residence.\r\n\r\nCarney is a popular and picturesque village offering a range of amenities including local shop, café, pub and Local Link bus stop, while sporting and recreational facilities are also within easy reach.\r\n\r\nFor those who enjoy the outdoors, the property is particularly well positioned, with Lissadell Beach within 3.5 km, Benbulben / Gortarowey Forest Park circa 3.5 km, and the stunning Streedagh Beach only 10 km.\r\n\r\nAll services are available in Sligo c. 8.5 km, and Grange c. 6 km. Local primary and secondary schools are available in Rathcormack and Grange."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "GROUND FLOOR:\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall\r\n3.5m x 1.9m\r\nLaminate Wood Flooring.\r\n \r\nLiving Room\r\n5.5m x 3.5m \r\nLaminate Wood Flooring. Feature fireplace. Bay window. Double Doors to Kitchen / Dining. \r\n\r\nKitchen/ Dining Room\r\n5.5m x 3.9m\r\nLaminate Wood Flooring. Bay window overlooking south facing rear garden.\r\n\r\nWC \r\n1.9m x 1.7m\r\nTiled flooring. WC and WHB.\r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR \r\n\r\nBedroom 1\r\n3.8m x 2.9m\r\nLaminate Wood Flooring. Fitted wardrobe. En-Suite off. Double doors to balcony. \r\n\r\nEn-Suite\r\n1.8m x 1.6m\r\nTiled floor & shower surround. Electric shower. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\n3.3m x 3.0m\r\nLaminate Wood Flooring. Double doors to balcony. \r\n\r\nBedroom 3 \r\n3.1m x 2.5m\r\nLaminate Wood Flooring. \r\n\r\nBathroom\r\n2.3m x 2.1m\r\nTiled floor & shower / bath surround."
      },
